<div class="info-page">

    <header class="info-hero">
        <span class="info-eyebrow">Help Centre</span>
        <h1 class="info-title">How can we help you?</h1>
        <p class="info-subtitle">
            Quick answers to common questions about browsing stays, booking rooms, hosting properties, and keeping your account safe.
        </p>
    </header>

    <section class="info-grid-3">
        <div class="feature-tile">
            <h3>Bookings &amp; Stays</h3>
            <p>How to search by city, compare room categories, check availability, and confirm your stay.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-tile">
            <h3>Hosting on Stayora</h3>
            <p>Upgrade to a Host account, list your property, manage rooms, and get verified.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-tile">
            <h3>Account &amp; Security</h3>
            <p>OTP email verification, Google sign-in, password resets, and session safety.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-card-white">
        <h2 class="info-section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <div class="faq-list">
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>How do I book a room on Stayora?</summary>
                <p class="faq-answer">
                    Browse properties on the Stays page, click "View More" on any property you like, scroll down to the "Choose your room" section, and click "Book This Room". Make sure you are logged into your Stayora account to complete your booking.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>How do I become a Host and list my property?</summary>
                <p class="faq-answer">
                    Log in to your Stayora account and click "+ Become a Host" in the top navigation bar. Your account role will be upgraded to Host, giving you access to your Host Dashboard where you can add and manage your properties.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>What does "Verified Host" mean?</summary>
                <p class="faq-answer">
                    A Verified Host badge indicates that the host's account and property details have been reviewed and approved by the Stayora team for quality and authenticity.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>Where can I check check-in, check-out, and cancellation policies?</summary>
                <p class="faq-answer">
                    Every property detail page clearly displays the exact check-in time, check-out time, and cancellation policy (Flexible, Moderate, or Strict) under the "Things to know" section before you book.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>I forgot my password. How can I reset it?</summary>
                <p class="faq-answer">
                    Go to the Login page and click "Forgot Password". Enter your registered email address and follow the secure reset link sent to your inbox.
                </p>
            </details>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-cta-bar">
        <h2>Still need help?</h2>
        <p>Our support team is just a phone call or email away.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="info-btn">Contact Us</a>
    </section>

</div>
